## Upstash Redis

### Client singleton
```typescript
// lib/redis.ts
import { Redis } from '@upstash/redis'

export const redis = new Redis({
  url:   process.env.UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL!,
  token: process.env.UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN!,
})
```

### Key naming convention
```
<entity>:<tenantId>:<identifier>

Examples:
  session:<tenantId>:<sessionId>
  ratelimit:<tenantId>
  cache:hit-count:<tenantId>
```

### Always set TTL
```typescript
// ✅
await redis.set(`session:${tenantId}:${id}`, data, { ex: 3600 })

// ❌ Never set without expiry — storage grows unbounded
await redis.set(`session:${tenantId}:${id}`, data)
```

